  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce tuberculosis prevalence, incidence, and mortality by strengthening integrated care of promotion, prevention and cure services, with a focus on the person, family and community; with support of multisectors and civil society - Guatemala (01-Jul-2025-30-Jun-2028)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guatemala, Tuberculosis, Ministry of Health and Social Assistance of the Republic of Guatemala (MSPAS)This program has the following goals: Reducir la prevalencia, incidencia, mortalidad y el sufrimiento humano por tuberculosis en el pa&#xed;s, fortaleciendo la atenci&#xf3;n integrada de servicios de promoci&#xf3;n, prevenci&#xf3;n y curaci&#xf3;n, con enfoque centrado en la persona, la familia y la comunidad;  contando con el apoyo e involucramiento multisectorial y de la sociedad civil. / Reduce the prevalence, incidence, mortality and human suffering due to tuberculosis in the country, strengthening integrated care of promotion, prevention and cure services, with a focus on the person, family and community; with the support and involvement of multisectors and civil society.. The objectives of this program are: Fortalecer la prevenci&#xf3;n y atenci&#xf3;n integrada e integral de la tuberculosis centrada en la persona, familia, comunidad y su entorno, principalmente en grupos de alto riesgo. / Strengthen integrated and comprehensive prevention and care of tuberculosis focused on the person, family, community and their environment, mainly in high-risk groups..  Fortalecer el compromiso de las comunidades, las organizaciones de la sociedad civil y todos los proveedores de atenci&#xf3;n p&#xfa;blicos y privados para el control de la TB / Strengthen the commitment of communities, civil society organizations and all public and private care providers for TB control.  Mejorar la calidad y oportunidad del sistema de informaci&#xf3;n y notificaci&#xf3;n de casos de TB y mortalidad por TB, / Improve the quality and timeliness of the information and notification system for TB cases and TB mortality,</narrative>
  </description>
